A quoted comment or attribute line closes the quote's paragraph

````
::: note
> para
> %% c
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <blockquote><p>para</p></blockquote>
  <pre><code>code
::::
:::
after *b*
</code></pre>
</aside>
````

